BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 720.00 Tm (DOC_ID: SAFETY_DOC_006) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 706.80 Tm (TITLE: Hepatrol - Notice to Prescribers Regarding Hepatic Monitoring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 693.60 Tm (PUBLISHER: HealthOne Group Office of the Chief Pharmacist) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 680.40 Tm (PUBLICATION_DATE: 2026-01-20) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 667.20 Tm (STATUS: ACTIVE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 654.00 Tm (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 640.80 Tm (NOTICE TO PRESCRIBERS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 614.40 Tm (Notice number: SAFETY_DOC_006) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 601.20 Tm (Date: 20 January 2026) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 588.00 Tm (From: Office of the Chief Pharmacist) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 574.80 Tm (Action: For attention of all clinicians initiating or continuing Hepatrol) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 548.40 Tm (| SYNTHETIC DOCUMENT - NOT REAL MEDICAL GUIDANCE. This notice is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 535.20 Tm (| fabricated for a software demonstration. Hepatrol is an invented medication.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 522.00 Tm (| It describes no real product and must not inform any clinical decision.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 495.60 Tm (1. Why you are receiving this notice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 469.20 Tm (Colleagues have asked for clarification on which laboratory tests are, and are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 456.00 Tm (not, required during Hepatrol therapy. This notice answers that question. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 442.80 Tm (is prompted by a review of practice, not by any new safety signal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 416.40 Tm (2. What is required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 390.00 Tm (Patients established on Hepatrol who have chronic liver disease should have) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 376.80 Tm (ALT measured at 12-week intervals for as long as therapy continues.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 350.40 Tm (Please note the interval carefully. It is expressed in weeks because that is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 337.20 Tm (how the underlying pharmacokinetic work was reported, and it should be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 324.00 Tm (implemented as stated rather than rounded to a calendar quarter. Requests for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 310.80 Tm (the test should be timed from the previous result, not from a fixed date in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 297.60 Tm (the month.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 271.20 Tm (This requirement is effective from the date of this notice.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 244.80 Tm (3. What is not required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 218.40 Tm (Three tests are commonly requested alongside ALT and are not required by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 205.20 Tm (this notice:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 178.80 Tm (- Full blood count. Requested routinely at some sites. There is no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 165.60 Tm (  interval requirement for it in Hepatrol therapy. Order it if there is a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 152.40 Tm (  clinical reason to.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 139.20 Tm (- Serum albumin. Frequently ordered as part of a liver panel. Useful for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 126.00 Tm (  characterising established disease; it is not a monitoring test for this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 112.80 Tm (  medication and carries no required interval.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 99.60 Tm (- Prothrombin time. Appropriate where there is clinical concern about) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 86.40 Tm (  synthetic function. Not required on any schedule here.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 40 Tm (Page 1 of 2 - SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DOCUMENT) Tj ET
endstream
