BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 720.00 Tm (Ordering these tests is not discouraged. The point of this section is that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 706.80 Tm (their absence from a patient's record is not a monitoring failure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 680.40 Tm (4. Patients without chronic liver disease) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 654.00 Tm (The requirement in section 2 is specific to patients carrying that diagnosis.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 640.80 Tm (Hepatrol recipients without chronic liver disease are not within its scope.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 614.40 Tm (5. Questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 588.00 Tm (Direct queries to your site pharmacy lead in the first instance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 561.60 Tm (- Ends -) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 40 Tm (Page 2 of 2 - SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DOCUMENT) Tj ET
